la biblioteca Turtle. Resoldre tasques reals usant Python i aplicar un enfocament iteratiu per crear projectes', '', '', '', '', '', '', TRUE, 'https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/55/55/1783540800000/S7v_57NMnZbJwIjILY_RvQ/00eeDlfvX0vdsZ_aA_sBJKk34AiThnZzd5W02b3oz5fKZPwpiY157yLaP6yYwKboqQxzuXRvjvmXhkAeWXSkVgEAVvv_eYqHrfy6AorxX6AJV101NzzGmgJxMKG8wxj3-kSK0ZSavt2YnMbAnYfRmg/Y3XZsDz3fry1aE4Wld0x89GfqMwllDspyWEb_sSwkN0', 'https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/55/55/1783540800000/dw3bCbzYayWENoFqHPCg9g/PkhgoWI3p9wGkEwd_JPyL2fnd2DSjvmNYRYVPDYzsz-mLiX9AzLCE_kLYRz43mb21elFNxxMCAQebvy8UK_2VkOVDlDDhGu4JY5_XoctNxd87Lf-bQK9xT3VZLgncwg8xXZjvMU_8-LgQXhe4T6ueg/wR-kUeWp7rT5w7-rVmOAxDJSEhTnmAMIF0SJM6XZnaA', '{}', '', 'Extraescolar', '', '', '', '', 'girona')
